{"route":"/docs/5.3/components/button-group/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Button group","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Group a series of buttons together on a single line or stack them in a vertical column."},"blocks":[{"id":"basic-example","type":"heading","en":"Basic example","level":2},{"id":"basic-example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Wrap a series of buttons with <code>.btn</code> in <code>.btn-group</code>."},{"id":"basic-example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"1b3386979877c4e8efa3","height":147},{"id":"basic-example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Basic example\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Left</button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Middle</button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Right</button>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"basic-example--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"basic-example--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"Button groups require an appropriate <code>role</code> attribute and explicit label to ensure assistive technologies like screen readers identify buttons as grouped and announce them. Use <code>role=&quot;group&quot;</code> for button groups or <code>role=&quot;toolbar&quot;</code> for button toolbars. Then use <code>aria-label</code> or <code>aria-labelledby</code> to label them."}]},{"id":"basic-example--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"These classes can also be added to groups of links, as an alternative to the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/components/navs-tabs\"><code>.nav</code> navigation components</a>."},{"id":"basic-example--example-2","type":"demo","key":"850e1147392b155e6768","height":147},{"id":"basic-example--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"btn-group\">\n  <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary active\" aria-current=\"page\">Active link</a>\n  <a